  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.33333334326744 cup vegetable oil",
    "1 egg",
    "0.33333334326744 cup milk, or more as needed",
    "1 cup fresh blueberries",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 cup butter, cubed",
    "1.5 teaspoons ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SMcpl4zkuqIpMaJX9uUZMJaWluw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6865-To-Die-For-Blueberry-Muffins-ddmfs-step-0-1ac64dc1ff154b4eba417973ef81ba39.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Grease 8 muffin cups or line with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9g33eLhG1qOlJRMrj6SlDDh3asQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6865-To-Die-For-Blueberry-Muffins-ddmfs-step-1-8509a48f3e85488fa2c92531f45c6c4a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the muffins: Whisk flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IXoaibR8-XJai5WntnFbJXlwaWE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6865-To-Die-For-Blueberry-Muffins-ddmfs-step-2-f4bc718caa864c94b54ac7f36d436a0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour oil into a small liquid measuring cup. Add egg and enough milk to reach the 1-cup mark; stir until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lIXUQZAYI2or1R8PUgTg0icy9TA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6865-To-Die-For-Blueberry-Muffins-ddmfs-step-3-a945ac5099a24bfebc10beb705996e46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into flour mixture and mix just until batter is combined. Fold in blueberries; set batter aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OnT62qi-X_hYhxPXvS2iYNEA7DY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6865-To-Die-For-Blueberry-Muffins-ddmfs-step-4-B-1ff03f82073b4963805af67fb8067548.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crumb topping: Combine sugar, flour, butter, and cinnamon in a small bowl. Mix with a fork until crumbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Leuwy4k4S8DeALytGIhpdTInq_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6865-To-Die-For-Blueberry-Muffins-ddmfs-step-5-c8edb13d76154c0597363965065f56c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling right to the top. Sprinkle with crumb topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted in the center of a muffin comes out clean, 20 to 25 minutes. Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w4mqXHWaUQtNhz_NDLHmGfmy3lI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6865-to-die-for-blueberry-muffins-VAT-019-4x3-dfe4a5ca62eb49559c3431b00c266f37.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6865/step_08.webp"
    }
